{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "kind": "archify-explainer-prepared",
  "document": {
    "schema_version": 1,
    "diagram_type": "explainer",
    "meta": {
      "title": "缓存未命中时，请求为什么变慢？",
      "id": "mechanism",
      "locale": "zh-CN"
    },
    "answer": {
      "summary": "缓存未命中后，请求要多等**数据库查询和同步写回缓存**两段。",
      "reasons": [
        "命中时，接口读到缓存值就能返回。",
        "未命中时，接口必须先拿到数据库结果。",
        "同步写回位于响应之前，写完缓存才能结束请求。"
      ],
      "scope": "示例采用旁路缓存：GET返回空值后查询PostgreSQL，查询成功后同步SET再响应；无并行、重试或其他缓存层。未实测耗时，具体慢多少由链路测量决定。"
    },
    "panels": [
      {
        "id": "timeline",
        "title": "一次未命中，时间花在哪？",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "steps",
            "id": "cache-path-steps",
            "items": [
              {
                "id": "get-step",
                "text": "读取缓存",
                "detail": "GET返回空值，接口继续向数据库查询。[](source:get-doc)"
              },
              {
                "id": "query-step",
                "text": "查询PostgreSQL",
                "detail": "等待数据库执行SQL并返回结果。"
              },
              {
                "id": "set-step",
                "text": "同步写回Redis",
                "detail": "SET完成后，接口返回响应。[](source:set-doc)"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "diff",
        "title": "命中和未命中，差在哪几步？",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "comparison",
            "id": "cache-comparison",
            "columns": [
              "命中",
              "未命中"
            ],
            "rows": [
              {
                "label": "读Redis",
                "cells": [
                  {
                    "text": "取得值",
                    "assessment": "good",
                    "verdict": "直接返回"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "取得空值",
                    "assessment": "caution",
                    "verdict": "继续查询"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "row-67fe9814e476"
              },
              {
                "label": "查PostgreSQL",
                "cells": [
                  {
                    "text": "跳过",
                    "assessment": "good",
                    "verdict": "省去查询"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "等待结果",
                    "assessment": "caution",
                    "verdict": "增加等待"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "row-bb530b3792c8"
              },
              {
                "label": "写回Redis",
                "cells": [
                  {
                    "text": "跳过",
                    "assessment": "good",
                    "verdict": "省去写回"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "同步SET",
                    "assessment": "caution",
                    "verdict": "增加等待"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "row-cbc9f8528502"
              },
              {
                "label": "响应路径",
                "cells": [
                  {
                    "text": "一段读取",
                    "assessment": "good",
                    "verdict": "路径短"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "三段顺序等待",
                    "assessment": "caution",
                    "verdict": "路径长"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "row-d108c6645625"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "checks",
        "title": "想缩短等待，先查什么？",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              "记录`cache=hit`或`cache=miss`，区分请求路径。",
              "分别观察GET、SQL和SET耗时，先处理最慢的一段。",
              "检查SQL索引与执行计划；改为异步写回前，设计写入失败的恢复流程。"
            ],
            "id": "list-7e8599e477aa"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "sources": [
      {
        "id": "get-doc",
        "title": "Redis GET：不存在的键返回空值",
        "url": "https://redis.io/docs/latest/commands/get/"
      },
      {
        "id": "set-doc",
        "title": "Redis SET：设置键值",
        "url": "https://redis.io/docs/latest/commands/set/"
      }
    ]
  },
